      en: ["At 156 meters, it is the highest summit in the province of West Flanders.", "Was the site of the bloody Battle of the Kemmelberg in April 1918.", "The hill served as a strategic fort for the Celts (Menapii).", "The steepest part of the climb features a gradient of 23%.", "A Cold War command bunker is located beneath the hill.", "Part of the hill chain of the Heuvelland region near the French border."],
